Burn_out_Loop - A VR experience


////////Aesthetic and Art////////////

The game takes place in an apartment, 3D, Low Poly
    
    
 3 different LUTs

    Main LUT 
        Noir, cartoonish, heavy contrast
    CleanLUT
        Pastel, Cartoonish, almost no contrast
    Fire LUT
        Monochrome, cartoonish, heavy contrast

////////The game logic////////////// 

Core Loop - PART 1
Q1
    The user interacts with item in order to clean the room. 
        When the user interacts with an item said item dissappears from the room and spawns 10 more in the other rooms.
        When the user completes cleaning a room, the LUT goes from noir to pastel in that specific room only.
           Repeats 2 times
    END

Q2
    The user goes to study. Iteraction in this quest is the same as in the Q1.
        When the user touches a book, 10 more appear, this time, next to him
        The user has to place them in the library next to him. 
            When the library is full Q2 is complete.

Q3
    The user interacts with the food in the kitchen. There's a hunger bar he needs to fill
        User touches a food item and the rest around it dissappear.
        User needs to interact with fridge and kitchen to cook
            Repeats 10 to fill the bar

Q4
    The user needs to get in the shower. Then evvents happen in the following order
        1- The water turns to fire
        2- The whole apartment burns
        3- The only water around is the bed that looks like a pool

END OF PART 1


    The burning scene

        The shower head is a trigger
            starts spilling Particle System
            After 3 seconds there will be the FireLUT gradually taking over
            There will be a fake health bar on top 
                (that slowly runs out of time... actually it's a timer)
            The only way to stop the timer (that dissappears on collision) is with the bed
                 (that switches materials when the player interacts with the showerhead)


